    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The past: ました",
     "texto": [
      "For the past, **ます** changes to **ました**: **たべます** → **たべました** (I ate, I have eaten).",
      "The negative past is **ませんでした**: **たべませんでした** (I didn't eat).",
      "As always, the form is the same for all people."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "The four polite forms",
