    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The past of です",
     "texto": [
      "**です** in the past is **でした**: **がくせい でした** (was a student), **いい りょこう でした** (was a good trip).",
      "Its negative is **じゃ ありませんでした** (was not).",
      "Past words: **きのう** (yesterday), **せんしゅう** (last week), **きょねん** (last year)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
